The entire proceeding of Case No. 1255 of 2021;
State Vs. Avinash Singh and others;, arising out of Case Crime No. 91 of 2019, under Sections 498A,
323, 504, 506 IPC and 3/4 D.P. Act, Police Station Mahila Thana, District Kanpur Nagar, pending in the Court of learned Civil Judge (Junior Division) F.T.C. (C.A.W.), Kanpur Nagar, are hereby quashed.

